@ARTICLE{Messing2015-TheLethalityScreenThePredictiveValidityOfAnIntimatePartnerViolenceRiskAssessmentForUseByFirstRespondersThePredictiveValidityOfAnIntimatePartnerViolenceRiskAssessment-..-ic,
