@ARTICLE{Hao2020-DoPsychiatricPatientsExperienceMorePsychiatricSymptomsDuringCOVID-19PandemicAndLockdownACase-controlStudyWithServiceAndResearchImplicationsForImmunopsychiatry-..-md,
