of this study as well as ideas for future research are also given. Unwanted Relationship Pursuit and Stalking in Japan Stalking has probably occurred in various forms since the dawn of pair-bonded relationships. Certainly the written record of stalking type relationships dates back to antiquity (see Cupach \& Spitzberg, 2(04). Yet, the process of stalking was not designated as a legal entity until it was made",
