author = "Mamun, Mohammed A and Sakib, Najmuj and Gozal, David and Bhuiyan, Akm Israfil and Hossain, Sahadat and Bodrud-Doza, Md and Al Mamun, Firoj and Hosen, Ismail and Safiq, Mariam Binte and Abdullah, Abu Hasnat and Sarker, Md Abedin and Rayhan, Istihak and Sikder, Md Tajuddin and Muhit, Mohammad and Lin, Chung-Ying and Griffiths, Mark D and Pakpour, Amir H",
