@ARTICLE{Sorg2013-FootPatrolInViolentCrimeHotSpotsTheLongitudinalImpactOfDeterrenceAndPosttreatmentEffectsOfDisplacementFootPatrolInViolentCrimeHotSpots-..-bh,
