@ARTICLE{Buker2024-CarryingAHandgunInPublicVsTakingAHandgunToSchoolAmongYouthAnExplorationOfThePredictingPowerOfRiskFactorsRelatedToDelinquencyAggressionAndVictimization-..-xa,
