author = "Socatiyanurak, Vorada and Klangpornkun, Nittayapa and Munthuli, Adirek and Phienphanich, Phongphan and Kovudhikulrungsri, Lalin and Saksakulkunakorn, Nantawat and Chairaungsri, Phonkanok and Tantibundhit, Charturong",
